  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word used heavily in official documents, laws, regulations, and business contexts. The noun form {防止|ぼうし} frequently appears in compound terms.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {事故|じこ}{防止|ぼうし} (accident prevention)\n- {再発|さいはつ}{防止|ぼうし} (recurrence prevention)\n- {犯罪|はんざい}{防止|ぼうし} (crime prevention)\n- {汚染|おせん}{防止|ぼうし} (pollution prevention)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {予防|よぼう}する: to prevent — focuses on advance precaution, especially for health\n- {防|ふせ}ぐ: to prevent, to defend — everyday verb, broader usage",
